# T-977: Unit constructor injection produces qualified Variant tag.
# Color: [type Red Green Blue] injects Red, Green, Blue as dict entries.
# Tags are qualified as "Color.Red", "Color.Green", "Color.Blue" (T-974).
# After T-1193, constructors are accessed via Color.Red (dot notation).
[
  Color: [type Red Green Blue]
  value: Color.Red
]

=== out
Dict({"Color": Dict({"Red": Variant(Color.Red, Null), "Green": Variant(Color.Green, Null), "Blue": Variant(Color.Blue, Null)}), "value": Variant(Color.Red, Null)})
